{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ministry of Information is hiring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After recent unrest in the country, the leadership has decided to tighten control over information. You have been entrusted with the position of junior editor.<br>From this day forward, it is you who decides what the citizens will learn from the news \u2014 and what will disappear forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your responsibilities include:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reviewing and evaluating daily news reports.<br>Editing headlines and articles in strict accordance with official directives.<br>Monitoring for \u201cforbidden words\u201d.<br>Reporting to your superiors at the end of each working day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every approved or rejected article shapes the fate of the nation, the mood of its people, and your own career.<br>Mistakes will be noticed. Consequences are inevitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay vigilant. Obey orders.<br>We are watching.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3967060?t=1760385070","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3967060?t=1760385070","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967060/1e88b87fe94a3ff13f4b8f2445230380b4a7345d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760385070","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967060/1e88b87fe94a3ff13f4b8f2445230380b4a7345d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760385070","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains references to violence, political 